pinned_over_quota.detail:
Pinned is resident: every pinned claim rides along at the top of every session, so each one costs on every reply. A full set also blocks new pins. Entries that could not be pinned this time:
{{blockedList}}

How to fix: run `memory_admin(op='pinned')` to see the set. Keep only what must apply in every reply; take out the rest with `memory_admin(op='set_pinned', id=…, on=false)` — it stays in memory and recall still finds it. Once you are at {{quota}} or below, pin the entries listed above if they still need to apply in every reply.
